==== JTAG ====

The unpopulated 2x6 SMT 2mm pitch pads left of the BCM5325 are almost certainly [[docs:techref:hardware:port.jtag#pin_header1|a 12-pin JTAG pinout]], since half of them are grounds and the other half go straight to the SoC.
